# Generated acceptance evidence and local rendering fixtures.
output/

# A Windows artifact path passed to a WSL-hosted browser controller becomes a
# literal Linux filename (for example, `C:\\Temp\\capture.png`). Keep these
# cross-OS acceptance artifacts out of source control as well.
**/C:\\*.png
**/C:\\Temp\\*

# Private development documentation
# Keep public user/contributor documentation directly under docs/. Put local
# plans, drafts, reviews, handoffs, and generated evidence in one of these
# ignored directories so they can never be included in a GitHub push.
**/docs/internal/
**/docs/development/
**/docs/drafts/
**/docs/plans/
**/docs/reviews/
**/docs/superpowers/
**/docs/.private/
